integration.inkscape.install_extensions_.source:
Some files already exist in the InkSim extension folder. Files listed for replacement may contain user changes. Other listed files will be preserved and never deleted.

Files to replace:
{replace_files}

Files to preserve:
{preserve_files}

Continue?

integration.inkscape.install_extensions_.translation:
InkSim kengaytmalari papkasida ayrim fayllar allaqachon mavjud. Almashtirilishi ko‘rsatilgan fayllarda foydalanuvchi o‘zgartirishlari bo‘lishi mumkin. Ro‘yxatdagi boshqa fayllar saqlanadi va hech qachon o‘chirilmaydi.

Almashtiriladigan fayllar:
{replace_files}

Saqlanadigan fayllar:
{preserve_files}

Davom etasizmi?

integration.inkscape.remove_old_extensio.source:
The listed user extension folders and all files inside them will be permanently deleted. The current install/update target and system extension folders will not be removed.

{directories}

Continue?

integration.inkscape.remove_old_extensio.translation:
Ro‘yxatdagi foydalanuvchi kengaytmalari papkalari va ulardagi barcha fayllar butunlay o‘chiriladi. Joriy o‘rnatish/yangilash manzili va tizim kengaytmalari papkalari o‘chirilmaydi.

{directories}

Davom etasizmi?
